        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:36:14.963Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Amazon SageMaker HyperPod is a purpose-built AI service that simplifies the management of large-scale compute clusters for gen AI workloads.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/share-gpu-clusters-across-teams-with-isolation-and-fairness-using-amazon-sagemaker-hyperpod/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-08T16:20:04.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:36:14.963Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Figure 1: High-level multi-tenant architecture for two teams sharing one HyperPod EKS cluster",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/share-gpu-clusters-across-teams-with-isolation-and-fairness-using-amazon-sagemaker-hyperpod/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
